# --- data ---
# Raw FRED responses. Purely a politeness cache so re-runs don't hammer their
# servers; every byte is regenerable and none of it is the scientific record.
data/.fred-cache/

# The built panels ARE committed on purpose. FRED revises series and renames
# files yearly, so "just re-run the fetch script" does not reproduce the numbers
# quoted in CLAUDE.md and in the model's validation output. The panels are the
# vintage those conclusions were drawn from.
